{"labs": [{"id": 0, "type": "scholar", "stimuli": [{"template_override": 1, "contents": [{}], "type": "welcome", "id": 0, "_data": []}, {"type": "audio", "id": 1, "title": "", "template_override": 1, "contents": [{"type": "slideshow", "value": {"audiosrc": "engenn6le09ob06re2aud01", "images": [{"text": "", "id": 0, "image": "engenn6le09ob06re2img05.jpg", "time": "0"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Miranda</span>: That's a good point. I don't disagree that online sales could work. However, one of our company's core values is \u201cTest everything: assume nothing\u201d.  <br/><span class=\"strong\">Farmani</span>: I'm not sure that's always the case. Could you elaborate on that? <br/><span class=\"strong\">Miranda</span>: In my view, after all these years on the Internet, you just never know what strategy or angle is going to work best until you test it.", "id": 1, "image": "engenn6le09ob06re2img05.jpg", "time": "100"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Farmani</span>: I'm sure you are right. But the way I see it, their offer so far sounds better than what you have put on the table. What's your idea for our new clothing line? <br/><span class=\"strong\">Miranda</span>: Going back to what I was saying, our plan for the clothing line is to stage and sponsor big events to promote it \u2026 <br/><span class=\"strong\">Farmani</span>: Pardon me, but that's beyond the point. How do you reckon spending money on events translates into sales?", "id": 2, "image": "engenn6le09ob06re2img06.jpg", "time": "21700"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Miranda</span>: You could say that, but by sponsoring these events for clients, stakeholders, and the media, we are creating publicity for your new clothing line and boosting your product's desirability. <br/><span class=\"strong\">Farmani</span>: That's not really how I see it, I'm afraid. To be frank, I'm strongly considering what the Garcias have offered. I will wait for your final offer, however. <br/><span class=\"strong\">Miranda</span>: I understand, Mr. Farmani. I'm sure we'll come up with something that is mutually advantageous to both parties.", "id": 3, "image": "engenn6le09ob06re2img07.jpg", "time": "41900"}], "coverimg": "engenn6le09ob06re2img05.jpg"}}], "_data": []}], "_data": [{"type": "lab_options", "contents": [{"type": "has_nav", "content": true}, {"type": "has_exercise_controls", "content": true}]}], "exercises": [{"type": "WLC", "id": 0, "img_path": "", "template_override": 1, "questions": [], "stimuli_ids": [0], "_data": [{"type": "instructions", "contents": [{"type": "Learning Outcomes", "content": " I can ask for and give opinions."}, {"type": "Learning Outcomes", "content": " I can agree and disagree."}, {"type": "Learning Outcomes", "content": " I can talk about jobs and work."}, {"type": "Free Header Item", "content": "How do you prepare for a presentation? "}, {"type": "Free Header Item", "content": " Do you get nervous before presenting your ideas? Why or why not?"}]}, {"type": "group", "contents": [{"type": "group_name", "content": "Welcome"}]}, {"type": "feedback", "content": {"attempt_feedback": [{"type": "text", "content": "You have 2 tries"}, {"type": "text", "content": "you have 1 attempt left"}], "correct_feedback": "Correct", "incorrect_feedback": [{"type": "text", "content": "try again"}, {"type": "text", "content": "Maybe next time"}], "allowed_attempts": 2}}, {"type": "free_header_text", "content": "Ask your partner:"}, {"type": "free_type_text_area", "content": "Let's present ideas in a meeting!"}]}, {"stimuli_ids": [1], "id": 1, "template_override": 1, "questions": [{"responses": [{"id": 0, "selected": 0, "correct": 0, "_data": [{"type": "text", "content": ""}]}, {"id": 1, "selected": 0, "correct": 1, "_data": [{"type": "text", "content": ""}]}], "id": 0, "_data": [{"type": "question", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": ""}]}]}], "type": "STI", "_data": [{"type": "instructions", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": " Miranda and Mr. Farmani talk a